From bcaae0b89b5d2f7c511526a0c6da1342035665de Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 06:32:42 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] rpi3: AppleDiagnosticDataAccess(ReadOnly) stand-ins

iOS 10's MobileGestalt waits, with no deadline, for
AppleDiagnosticDataAccessReadOnly (the factory syscfg reader) to
appear. Its migrator never finished, accountsd held every client until
migration completed, and SpringBoard waited on accountsd forever.
Publish both services; their user clients have no data and refuse
every request.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0123xbco8JF8tibbBMLmXceV
